    "created_at": "2020-03-05T17:02:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-05T17:02:11Z",
    "body": "I agree with your analysis of the problem.\r\n\r\nAs for the solution, I think we'd need to add web platform tests for:\r\n\r\n- disconnected elements\r\n- elements whose parents are DocumentFragments\r\n- elements whose parents are ShadowRoots whose shadow hosts are translated-enabled\r\n- elements whose parents are ShadowRoots whose shadow hosts are no-translate\r\n\r\nand see what browsers are doing. Then we could figure out the correct wording based on the implementation consensus.\r\n\r\nWould you, or anyone else, be interested in writing such tests?",
