    "body": "Demo: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/10056\r\n\r\nIn Chromium and WebKit:\r\n```\r\nlog: No parent node: true\r\nlog: DocumentFragment parent node: true\r\nlog: ShadowRoot parent node whose shadow host is translation-enabled: true\r\nlog: ShadowRoot parent node whose shadow host is no-translate: true\r\nlog: Smoke test: the element itself has translate=no: false\r\n```\r\n\r\nGecko returns `undefined`.",
